 "main": "<div class=\"section\"><div class=\"w-container\"><div class=\"section-title-group\"><h1 class=\"section-heading centered\">Contact Us</h1><div class=\"section-subheading center\">For the fastest response, contact the Bailey's company you're working with directly.</div></div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:36px\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 28px\"><a class=\"button-2 w-button\" href=\"https://www.baileysallied.com/\">Bailey's Moving &amp; Storage</a><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0\">Moving and storage for households</p></div><div style=\"margin:0 0 28px\"><a class=\"button-2 w-button\" href=\"https://www.baileysallied.com/workplace\">Bailey's Moving &amp; Storage: Workplace</a><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0\">Office moves, relocations and commercial projects</p></div><div style=\"margin:0 0 28px\"><a class=\"button-2 w-button\" href=\"https://baileyslogistics.com/\">Bailey's Logistics</a><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0\">Transportation, warehousing, final mile and logistics services</p></div><div style=\"margin:0 0 28px\"><a class=\"button-2 w-button\" href=\"https://baileyslogistics.com/transportation\">Legacy Transportation Systems</a><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0\">Freight transportation across the United States</p></div></div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:12px\"><h2 class=\"section-heading centered\">Get a Quote</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.baileysallied.com/get-pricing\">Get a moving quote from Bailey's Moving &amp; Storage</a></p><p><a href=\"https://baileyslogistics.com/contact\">Get a logistics quote from Bailey's Logistics</a></p></div></div></div>",
